+# Bug Fix: Authenticated customer cart and checkout flow
+
+- **Slug**: ticket
+- **Fixed**: 2026-11-18T22:05:00Z
+- **Assessment**: ./assessment.md
+- **Status**: applied
+
+## Summary
+
+Authenticated cart POST/PUT requests now associate carts with the authenticated customer and enforce ownership on cart access, current-cart lookup, totals, and checkout. Customer order queries now filter by customer and use correct page metadata; authenticated checkout validation preserves the expected 400 response for mismatched amounts.
+
+## Changes
+
+| File | Change | Notes |
+|------|--------|-------|
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/shoppingCart/ShoppingCartApi.java` | modified | Resolve authenticated customers for cart mutations and prevent authenticated reads of foreign carts. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/shoppingCart/facade/ShoppingCartFacade.java` | modified | Added customer-scoped cart modification contract. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/shoppingCart/facade/ShoppingCartFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Claim anonymous carts for the authenticated customer and reject foreign cart codes. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/facade/shoppingCart/ShoppingCartFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Enforce ownership for optional cart-code lookup. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/repositories/shoppingcart/ShoppingCartRepository.java` | modified | Current-cart query is store/customer scoped, unfinished-cart only, and newest modified first. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/services/shoppingcart/ShoppingCartServiceImpl.java` | modified | Use the scoped current-cart query. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/order/OrderTotalApi.java` | modified | Stop processing after missing authenticated customer instead of falling through to a 503. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/order/OrderApi.java` | modified | Reject foreign carts and map wrapped amount-validation failures to HTTP 400. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/order/facade/OrderFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Pass authenticated order-list page/count as page-based criteria. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/repositories/order/OrderRepositoryImpl.java` | modified | Apply `customerId` to both count and result queries. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/utils/RepositoryHelper.java` | modified | Calculate page count with ceiling division. |
+
+## Tests Added or Updated
+
+- No new automated test files were added; the existing integration suite requires a configured application/database fixture not present in this checkout.
+
+## Local Verification
+
+- Commands run: `mvn -pl sm-shop -am -DskipTests compile` → passed after fixing initial compile feedback; all six reactor modules compiled successfully.
+- Manual checks: reviewed the authenticated cart, total, checkout, repository filtering, and pagination paths; `git diff --check` passed.
+
+## Deviations from Assessment
+
+The assessment proposed new focused integration tests, but none were added because this checkout does not expose a ready-to-run authenticated API fixture or database configuration. The implementation uses the existing cart audit `dateModified` field for deterministic current-cart ordering rather than adding a schema field.
+
+## Follow-ups
+
+- Run the authenticated integration/API suite against a configured database and payment fixture.
+- Add end-to-end regression tests for the four ticket scenarios when those fixtures are available.
